  "created": "2026-09-26T00:36:03.343Z",
  "description": "Umbraco's built-in Copy duplicates a subtree but copies property values verbatim, so every Content Picker, Multinode Treepicker, Multi URL Picker and rich-text internal link in the copies still points at the original pages. TrueCopy adds a True Copy action that performs the copy and then repoints every internal link whose target was itself part of the copy. Links pointing outside the copy are left alone but are counted and listed afterwards, because that is the one thing an editor cannot see for themselves. Custom property editors can be supported by implementing ILinkRewriter.",
